      "ref": "BDB, תְּבוּאָה",
      "preview": "תְּבוּאָה: produção agrícola, rendimento, receita e proveito figurado.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">תְּבוּאָה</span></big>  <strong>substantivo feminino</strong> <em>proventus</em>, <strong>produto, rendimento</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">תּ׳</span> em uso absoluto <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:37\" href=\"/Psalms.107.37\">ψ 107:37</a> + 3 vezes; estado construto <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּבוּאַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 23:39\" href=\"/Leviticus.23.39\">Lv 23:39</a> + 11 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּבוּאָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 31:12\" href=\"/Job.31.12\">Jb 31:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 8:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.8.19\">Pr 8:19</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּבוּאָתְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 14:28\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.14.28\">Dt 14:28</a> + 2 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּבוּאָתֶ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.9\">Pr 3:9</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּבוּאָתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:25\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.25\">Lv 19:25</a> + <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 48:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.48.18\">Ez 48:18</a> Qr (Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">תבואתה</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּבוּאָתֹה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.3\">Je 2:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּבוּאָתָהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:10\" href=\"/Exodus.23.10\">Ex 23:10</a> + 7 vezes + <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 48:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.48.18\">Ez 48:18</a> Kt (assim Co); <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּבוּאָתֵנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:20\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.20\">Lv 25:20</a>; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּבוּאֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:15\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.15\">Lv 25:15</a> + 4 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּבוּאוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.4\">Pr 14:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.8\">16:8</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּבוּאֹתֵיכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 12:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.12.13\">Je 12:13</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>produto, produção</em>, geralmente da terra (= colheitas etc.) <span dir=\"rtl\">תּ׳ הָאָרֶץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:10\" href=\"/Exodus.23.10\">Ex 23:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:25\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.25\">Lv 19:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 23:39\" href=\"/Leviticus.23.39\">23:39</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:3\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.3\">25:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:7\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.7\">7</a> (utilizado como alimento por seres humanos e animais; cf. v. <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:22\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.22\">22</a>) <a data-ref=\"Joshua 5:12\" href=\"/Joshua.5.12\">Jos 5:12</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:37\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.37\">Ne 9:37</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:15\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.15\">Lv 25:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:16\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.16\">16</a>, também <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 48:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.48.18\">Ez 48:18</a>; em <a data-ref=\"Genesis 47:24\" href=\"/Genesis.47.24\">Gn 47:24</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּתּ׳</span> deve significar <em>das colheitas</em> (<span dir=\"rtl\">בּ</span> partitivo, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span> <strong>I. 2. b.</strong>; 𝔊 suprime <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">תּ׳ שָׂדֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 8:6\" href=\"/II_Kings.8.6\">2 K 8:6</a> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 31:5\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.31.5\">2 Ch 31:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תּ׳ כֶּרֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 22:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.22.9\">Dt 22:9</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:37\" href=\"/Psalms.107.37\">ψ 107:37</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לֶחֶם תּ׳ הָאֲדָמָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.23\">Is 30:23</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תּ׳ גֹּרֶן</span> e <span dir=\"rtl\">תּ׳ יָ֑קֶב</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:30\" href=\"/Numbers.18.30\">Nu 18:30</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תּ׳ זֶרַע</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 14:22\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.14.22\">Dt 14:22</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תּ׳ דָּגָן</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 32:28\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.32.28\">2 Ch 32:28</a>; enquanto propriedade dos lavradores ou do povo <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:20\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.20\">Lv 25:20</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 14:28\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.14.28\">Dt 14:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 16:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.16.15\">16:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 26:12\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.26.12\">26:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.9\">Pr 3:9</a>; colheitas determinadas pela estação, <span dir=\"rtl\">תּ׳ שָׁ֑מֶשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 33:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.33.14\">Dt 33:14</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">גֶּרֶשׁ יְרָחִים</span>); <em>produção</em> de um ano <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:12\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.12\">Lv 25:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:22\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.22\">22</a>; cf. v. <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:21\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.21\">21</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">עָשָׂה תּ׳</span>, sujeito: <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁנָה</span>.<br><strong>2.</strong> <strong>a.</strong>  <em>renda, receita</em>, em geral <a data-ref=\"Job 31:12\" href=\"/Job.31.12\">Jb 31:12</a> (quase = bens, posses) <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.16\">Pr 10:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.4\">14:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 15:6\" href=\"/Proverbs.15.6\">15:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 16:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.16.8\">16:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 5:9\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.5.9\">Ec 5:9</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 23:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.23.3\">Is 23:3</a> (receita de Tiro proveniente do comércio de cereais com o Egito). <strong>b.</strong>  figuradamente: <em>proveito</em> da sabedoria <span dir=\"rtl\">תּ׳ תָכְמָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 13:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.13.14\">Pr 13:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 8:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.8.19\">8:19</a>; <em>produto dos lábios</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">(תּ׳ שְׂפָתָיו)</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:20\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.20\">Pr 18:20</a>, isto é, resultados de suas palavras (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּרִי פִי־אִישׁ</span>); de Israel como produto de Yahweh <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 2:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.2.3\">Je 2:3</a>; da perversidade de Israel <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 12:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.12.13\">Je 12:13</a>.",
