      "html": "† I. <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">בּוּז</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo: desprezar (</strong>hebraico pós-bíblico <em>idem</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  perfeito, 3.ª pessoa masculina singular <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּז</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 4:10\" href=\"/Zechariah.4.10\">Zc 4:10</a> (Kö<sup>i. 439</sup>); feminino <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּזָ֫ה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:21\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.21\">2 K 19:21</a> (GK 72<em>l</em>) imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יָבוּז</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.9\">Pr 23:9</a>; 3.ª pessoa feminina singular <span dir=\"rtl\">וְתָבֻז</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 30:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.30.17\">Pr 30:17</a>; 2.ª pessoa masculina singular <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּבוּז</span> (jussivo) <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.22\">Pr 23:22</a>; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">יָבוּזוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:30\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.30\">Pr 6:30</a> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 8:7\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.8.7\">Ct 8:7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יָבֻזוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 8:1\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.8.1\">Ct 8:1</a>; infinitivo absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">בּוֹז</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 8:7\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.8.7\">Ct 8:7</a>; particípio <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.12\">Pr 11:12</a> + 12 vezes;—<em>desprezar, tratar com desdém</em> (literatura sapiencial e poesia), com acusativo <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.7\">Pr 1:7</a>; com infinitivo + ל <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 30:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.30.17\">Pr 30:17</a>; em outras passagens, seguido de ל + substantivo <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:30\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.30\">Pr 6:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.12\">11:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 13:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.13.13\">13:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:21\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.21\">14:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.9\">23:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.22\">22</a> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 8:1\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.8.1\">Ct 8:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 8:7\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.8.7\">7</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 4:10\" href=\"/Zechariah.4.10\">Zc 4:10</a>.",
