      "html": "† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בּוּז</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.3\">Pr 18:3</a></sup> <strong>desprezo</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">בּ׳</span> em uso absoluto <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:23\" href=\"/Genesis.38.23\">Gn 38:23</a> + 9 vezes; estado construto <a data-ref=\"Job 31:34\" href=\"/Job.31.34\">Jb 31:34</a>;—(literatura sapiencial e poesia, exceto <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:23\" href=\"/Genesis.38.23\">Gn 38:23</a> J).<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>desprezo</em> originado do orgulho e da perversidade <a data-ref=\"Job 31:34\" href=\"/Job.31.34\">Jb 31:34</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 123:3\" href=\"/Psalms.123.3\">ψ 123:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 123:4\" href=\"/Psalms.123.4\">4</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">לַעַג</span>); reunido numa única locução adverbial com <span dir=\"rtl\">גאוה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:19\" href=\"/Psalms.31.19\">ψ 31:19</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּג׳ וָב׳</span>; proveniente da prosperidade e do conforto <a data-ref=\"Job 12:5\" href=\"/Job.12.5\">Jb 12:5</a>; = objeto de desprezo <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:23\" href=\"/Genesis.38.23\">Gn 38:23</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:8\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.8\">Pr 12:8</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶרְפָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:22\" href=\"/Psalms.119.22\">ψ 119:22</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:3\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.3\">Pr 18:3</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  de caráter judicial, derramado <span dir=\"rtl\">(שׁפך)</span> por Deus, em julgamento <a data-ref=\"Job 12:21\" href=\"/Job.12.21\">Jb 12:21</a> = <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:40\" href=\"/Psalms.107.40\">ψ 107:40</a>.",
